---
title: "Join us"
---

Joining the GAP is easy: just ask to become a member at our clubhouse.

By becoming a member you actively support the Group's activities, through the small fee paid when you join and through your participation in our initiatives. You can take part in the club's activities\*, elect the Board, vote at the annual General Meeting, vote on the Group's budget, and propose initiatives to the Board.

During club outings every member is covered by insurance.

Membership can be taken out at our clubhouse and costs _10 euros_ a year for adults and _5 euros_ for young people.

_\*for the more demanding outings, the outing leader reserves the right to assess each applicant's technical and physical ability before final acceptance, for the safety of the applicant and the other participants._
